The CVE Record Format
---------------------

src/cve/schema/, src/cve/datamodel/ and project/ model the CVE Record
Format, version 5.2.0, which the CVE Program publishes at
https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-schema (tag v5.2.0, commit
5533f6038cc0434e544e69240c704906d591de46). They are this project's rendering,
written in its own words. They are not the CVE Program's or MITRE's. CVE is a
trademark and the CVE logo is a registered trademark of The MITRE Corporation.

upstream/ holds files of that repository at that tag, each identical to its
counterpart there: the record format's JSON schema, its tag lists, its CVSS
schemas and the documentation's example records.
scripts/check_upstream_release.py pins each by its git object hash. The
repository is under Creative Commons CC0 1.0 Universal, which
upstream/LICENSE.txt holds in full.

